    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39855" root="نصأ" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَأَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَاَ</span></b> , <i>He took him by the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاصِيَة</span> [or
<i>forelock</i>]: (K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاصِيَةٌ</span>: and therefore regarded by some as improperly mentioned in the
K in this art. (MF.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَأَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَاَ</span></b> , (S, K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصْءٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He chid,</i> (a camel, TA, or
she-camel, S); syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَجَرَ</span>. (AZ, S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَأَ</span>,
(S, K,) inf. n. as above, (TA,) <i>He raised,</i> or
<i>elevated,</i> a thing: (Ks, AA, S, K:) dial. form
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَّ</span>. (S.)

